                                                "sense_id": "601e18dd-c5ad-3081-afdf-bad87f268485",
                                                "text": "Noel meets a cruel finish: \"Kid,\" the government lackey who \"protects\" the clubs in the tourist belt, shoots Noel dead in an alley for stealing Pining out of the brothel."
