                                                "example_id": "bcc1e400-d1fd-4fec-8911-355d353fcbf2",
                                                "sense_id": "61f430e5-c848-33d6-9fb3-3c4508652e2d",
                                                "text": "He completed the assignment on time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c692b001-75d5-4f18-ad59-58612868fe61",
                                                "sense_id": "61f430e5-c848-33d6-9fb3-3c4508652e2d",
                                                "text": "How far are you willing to reach?\n While you're coveting outcomes that you can't achieve\n Now you're on a mission, but you won't complete\n Shouldn't hold on to me, hold on to me\n Try to let go of me, let go of me"
